    <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#d97706;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=12;" value="DEPLOYMENT CONTROLS&#xa;• Default-deny network policies with explicit DNS, identity, backend, telemetry and management exceptions.&#xa;• Separate workload identities for control API, reconciliation worker and runtime; no shared cluster-admin credentials.&#xa;• Runtime traffic remains independent of management API availability; new policy application may pause.&#xa;• Scale, zone placement, disruption budgets, storage recovery and replica counts follow validated availability requirements.&#xa;• UI source reference is archived: select a compatible fork or maintained shell explicitly. Lab examples require version, license and OSS/Enterprise verification." vertex="1">
